# Mean values → the sum of the values divided by their count
Mean ⇐ {𝕊 𝕩: "implement me" ! 0}

# Range values → the largest value minus the smallest
Range ⇐ {𝕊 𝕩: "implement me" ! 0}

# Deviations values → each value minus the mean of the values
Deviations ⇐ {𝕊 𝕩: "implement me" ! 0}

# Variance values → the mean of the squared deviations
Variance ⇐ {𝕊 𝕩: "implement me" ! 0}

# mark Above values → how many values are greater than mark
Above ⇐ {𝕨 𝕊 𝕩: "implement me" ! 0}

# weights WeightedMean values → the sum of value × weight divided by the sum of the weights
WeightedMean ⇐ {𝕨 𝕊 𝕩: "implement me" ! 0}
